      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Indices (normalized difference)\nNDVI = (NIR-RED)/(NIR+RED)\nNDMI = (NIR-SWIR1)/(NIR+SWIR1)\nNDWI = (GREEN-NIR)/(GREEN+NIR)\nMSAVI = (2N+1 - sqrt((2N+1)^2\n         - 8(N-RED))) / 2\nmask v1: 0 nd, 1 valid, 2 cloud,\n3 shadow, 4 water;  keep {1,4}\nno NDRE / RECI (no red-edge)",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b067",
      "originalText": "Indices (normalized difference)\nNDVI = (NIR-RED)/(NIR+RED)\nNDMI = (NIR-SWIR1)/(NIR+SWIR1)\nNDWI = (GREEN-NIR)/(GREEN+NIR)\nMSAVI = (2N+1 - sqrt((2N+1)^2\n         - 8(N-RED))) / 2\nmask v1: 0 nd, 1 valid, 2 cloud,\n3 shadow, 4 water;  keep {1,4}\nno NDRE / RECI (no red-edge)",
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "index": "b0h",
